---
title: Orange-Almond Chicken
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Meat, Poultry, Fish
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@chicken breasts{6}
@honey{3/4%c}
@sliced almonds{3%oz}
@orange juice{1/4%c}
@butter{2%Tbsp}

Place chicken in a greased baking dish. Drizzle orange juice over the top. Bake covered for 45 minutes at 325 degrees. Melt @butter{2%Tbsp} with the honey and add almonds. Pour almond mixture over chicken and bake an additional 1/2 hour at 350 degrees.
